D306.1 Elevators (MDL 51(6)).

Notwithstanding the provisions of Section 3002.4 of the New York City Building Code, the installation of new elevators shall not be required where all of the following conditions apply:

1.The building was constructed prior to December 6, 1968;

2.The building does not have an elevator on the date of the application;

3.The building is or is being converted to a Class A multiple dwelling; and

